// REJECTS: Unexpected token '1'. Valid alternatives: ['EqualToJson', 'expected']
//
// The mirror of neg-service-equalto-given-embedded-data.pure. `EqualToJson`'s expected value
// is an embeddedData island -- `identifier ISLAND_OPEN ...` -- never a primitive; `EqualTo`'s
// is a primitive and never an island.
//
// Having both directions matters: a rewrite with one permissive "expected: anything" rule
// fails neither file, and a rewrite that swaps the two rules fails both. Only the pair
// distinguishes those cases from a correct implementation.
###Service
Service fixture::neg::EqualToJsonWithPrimitive
{
   pattern: '/x';
   documentation: 'd';
   execution: Single
   {
      query: |fixture::neg::Person.all();
      mapping: fixture::neg::M;
      runtime: fixture::neg::R;
   }
   testSuites:
   [
      suite1:
      {
         tests:
         [
            t1:
            {
               asserts:
               [
                  a1:
                     EqualToJson
                     #{
                        expected: 1;
                     }#
               ]
            }
         ]
      }
   ]
}
